# Local-development defaults for the TEST environment.
#
# This branch (test) deploys to the test stack, so every host here is a test host.
# The production hosts live on the `main` branch's copy of this file.
#
# MEDPLUM_GATEWAY_SERVICE_NAME is set explicitly rather than derived from the hostname.
# Derivation happens to work here (fhir-api-tst.healthtalk.ai -> fhir-api-tst) and does NOT
# work in production, where the slug is fhir-api-prd and the host is fhir-api.healthtalk.ai.
# A value that is only correct by coincidence is worth writing down.
#
# Vite loads this only when there is no .env and no MEDPLUM_BASE_URL in the process
# environment (see vite.config.ts), so on Vercel the dashboard variables win.
MEDPLUM_BASE_URL=https://fhir-api-tst.healthtalk.ai/
MEDPLUM_CLIENT_ID=
MEDPLUM_REGISTER_ENABLED=false
MEDPLUM_GATEWAY_ENABLED=true
MEDPLUM_GATEWAY_URL=https://authb2c-tst.healthtalk.ai
MEDPLUM_GATEWAY_SERVICE_NAME=fhir-api-tst
MEDPLUM_APP_NAME=HealthTalk
